---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Cleaning Services Glendale AZ | Diaz Cleaning LLC"
  description="Professional house & commercial cleaning services in Glendale, AZ. Local, trusted & affordable. Call (480) 479-4507 for a free quote."
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Cleaning Services in Glendale, AZ</h1>
      <p class="service-subtitle">Your local cleaning company in Glendale — serving homes and businesses with pride.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>

    <section class="service-content">
      <h2>Glendale's Trusted Cleaning Company</h2>
      <p>Diaz Cleaning LLC is based in Glendale, AZ and proudly serves homeowners and businesses throughout the city and surrounding areas. As a local company, we understand the needs of our community and are committed to delivering the best cleaning experience possible.</p>

      <h2>Cleaning Services in Glendale:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>House and apartment cleaning</li>
        <li>Deep cleaning services</li>
        <li>Commercial and office cleaning</li>
        <li>Window cleaning</li>
        <li>Move-in / move-out cleaning</li>
        <li>Building and condominium cleaning</li>
        <li>Industrial cleaning</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Neighborhoods We Serve in Glendale</h2>
      <p>We cover all of Glendale including Arrowhead, Westgate, Thunderbird, Maryvale and every neighborhood in between. We also serve nearby cities including Peoria, Surprise, Avondale, Goodyear and Phoenix.</p>

      <h2>Local, Reliable and Affordable</h2>
      <p>As a new company built on hard work and genuine commitment, we go above and beyond for every client in Glendale. We show up on time, pay attention to every detail and treat your space like it's our own. Try us once and you'll see the difference.</p>

      <h2>Servicios de Limpieza en Glendale, AZ</h2>
      <p>Diaz Cleaning LLC también ofrece servicios de limpieza profesional en español para hogares y negocios en Glendale y todo el Valle de Phoenix. Llámenos al (480) 479-4507 para un presupuesto gratuito.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Your Neighbors in Glendale — Ready to Help</h2>
      <p>Call us at <a href="tel:+14804794507">(480) 479-4507</a> or send us a message for a free quote. Same-day response guaranteed.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    font-family: 'Mulish', sans-serif;
  }
  .service-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .service-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .service-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .service-content p {
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .service-content ul li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: #444;
  }
  .service-content ul li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #9b308a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .service-cta {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f8f0fc;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .service-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-cta p {
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] {
    color: #9b308a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #9b308a;
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #4a1060; }
</style>